### FINAL DO GITIGNORE

##### KEEP FILES
!.gitkeep
!**/.gitkeep
!**/**/.gitkeep
!*gitkeep*
*git-keep*
!*keep-it*
*nohup*.out*
!*keepit*
*commit-it*
*commitit*

#### FINAL IGNOREFILES
*git-ignore*
*no*commit*
*No*Commit*
*NO*COMMIT*
